Package: vabaxos-apt
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: apt (>= 2.4), debian-archive-keyring, ca-certificates
Description: where VabaxOS gets its updates from
 The sources of APT for VabaxOS (ADR-0020): Debian at a date checked by
 VabaxOS (snapshot.debian.org), not Debian testing day by day, and the
 signed VabaxOS archive with the VabaxOS packages. APT reads its sources
 only from the files of this package; /etc/apt/sources.list, written by
 the installer and by live-build, is not used.
